---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import registry from '../data/themes.json';
---
<Base title="Learning Site themes"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Theme gallery</p><h1>Start with a readable foundation.</h1><p class="lede">These themes come from the official, generated Learning Site theme registry. Their compatibility range is validated alongside the engine.</p></section><section class="theme-grid">{registry.themes.map((theme) => <article class="theme-card"><div class="theme-preview" style={`--bg:${theme.preview.background};--accent:${theme.preview.accent}`}><span>{theme.preview.title}</span><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div><h2>{theme.name}</h2><p>{theme.preview.description}</p><dl><div><dt>Version</dt><dd>{theme.version}</dd></div><div><dt>Compatibility</dt><dd>Engine {theme.engine}</dd></div></dl></div></article>)}</section><p class="source-note">Theme previews and metadata are synchronized from the <a href="https://github.com/galtauba/learning-site-themes">official theme registry</a> during site builds.</p></Base>
